The package build completed successfully (tool exit code 0). The tool returned a truncated console stream, and no tee log was attached to that invocation, so this file does not reconstruct the full stdout. The complete 416-file build output is archived under packaging-v3 and its SHA-256 manifest is packaging-v3-manifest.json. The consumer gate output is preserved in package-consumer-v4.log and its own PASS receipt is consumer-verification-v4.json.
